{"id":"20.09.PartyFindItem","contentHtml":"<p>This project is my solo development exploring how a <strong>visual effect can become the basis of core mechanics</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a <strong>Solo Developer</strong>, I was responsible for everything: from game design and shaders to 3D modeling.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was to <strong>write a custom \"drunkenness\" post-effect from scratch</strong>, which would become the core of the gameplay.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\"Drunkenness\" Post-Effect on <code>HLSL</code>:</strong> A post-processing shader was written that creates a <strong>\"double vision\" effect</strong> by mixing the current frame with the saved previous one (<code>Render Texture</code>) in <code>OnRenderImage</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Gameplay Integration:</strong> The intensity of the effect is directly controlled by the <strong>drunkenness scale</strong>. Finding alcohol enhances the effect, non-alcoholic drinks weaken it. The scale decreases over time, motivating the search.</li>\n<li><strong>Procedural Placement:</strong> For replayability, all drinks are placed using my <strong>reusable 2D packing algorithm</strong> (<code>MaxRectsBinPack</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unique Gaming Experience:</strong> Successfully implemented gameplay where the visual effect is a <strong>key mechanic affecting difficulty</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> The project proves my ability to <strong>write custom post-effects from scratch</strong> and deeply integrate them into the gameplay.</li>\n<li><strong>Code Reuse:</strong> The procedural placement algorithm from the previous game was successfully applied in the project.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Party Find Item","date":"2020-09","type":"project","tagsArray":["Unity","C#","Blender","HLSL","PC"],"heroVideo":["frxe7AMSWOY"],"shortDescription":"<p>Solo project where the gameplay is built around a <strong>custom-written from scratch</strong> \"drunk\" post-effect.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/card.video?v=1765111414953&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/screenshots/0.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/screenshots/1.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/screenshots/2.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/20.09.PartyFindItem/screenshots/3.webp","width":1280,"height":720}]}